    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="4b8790ea-fccc-5922-a8cf-b1af1f9c14f7" activityNameId="1efefe6b-5749-545f-9d5e-1017d1e9e98b" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Door leaf, room, inner, wood, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Door leaf, room, inner, wood, at plant
The measures of the visible door leaf are 0.9m x 2m. 1m2 of visible wooden door leaf weighs 21.5kg. The bill of materials is based on data from door manufactures.;
UUID: c58dc8e4-f7ec-3b56-aa61-c8be6a91bb29
Included are the materials used in an inner room wooden door leaf (without surface treatment). Production losses, work materials, packaging materials, energy demand and the transport of the materials are also included.
Location: Data apply to the supply in Switzerland.
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data survey at 4 door manufactures in Switzerland. 
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c58dc8e4-f7ec-3b56-aa61-c8be6a91bb29.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="fdab769f-4bdb-5024-8349-c1745bbb2597" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
